  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 11a987a2e54cb2049b36ad32b48748e7, type: 3}
  m_Name: "4_\uC57D\uC81C\uC870"
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SubtitleData
  entries:
  - startTime: 0.6666667
    endTime: 2.2766666
    koText: "\uC774\uC81C \uB9C8\uC744\uC774 \uBCF4\uC5EC\uC694"
    enText: The village is in sight now
  - startTime: 2.7
    endTime: 4.08
    koText: "\uC774\uB7F4 \uB54C\uAC00 \uC544\uB2C8\uC5D0\uC694"
    enText: "This is no time to linger\u2014"
  - startTime: 4.08
    endTime: 6.21
    koText: "\uC5BC\uB978 \uC57D\uC744 \uB9CC\uB4E4\uC5B4\uC57C\uACA0\uC5B4\uC694"
    enText: I need to hurry and prepare the medicine
  - startTime: 6.516667
    endTime: 9.126667
    koText: "\uB450\uB354\uC9C0\uC640 \uB9E4\uB3C4 \uACE7 \uB3C4\uCC29\uD560 \uAC70\uC608\uC694"
    enText: The mole and hawk should arrive soon
  - startTime: 10.266666
    endTime: 12.446667
    koText: "\uB140\uC11D, \uC131\uACA9\uB3C4 \uAE09\uD558\uC9C0~"
    enText: "That little guy\u2014always in such a rush~"
  - startTime: 14.5
    endTime: 16.72
    koText: "\uD558\uC5EC\uAC04, \uB2E4\uC815\uD558\uB2E4\uB2C8\uAE4C~"
    enText: Honestly, so sweet of them~
  - startTime: 17.133333
    endTime: 21.043333
    koText: "\uC7AC\uB8CC\uAC00 \uB2E4 \uBAA8\uC600\uC5B4\uC694. \uC5BC\uB978 \uC57D\uC744
      \uC644\uC131\uD574 \uBCF4\uC8E0"
    enText: All the ingredients are here. Let's hurry and finish the medicine
  - startTime: 23.233334
    endTime: 27.063334
    koText: "\uC57D\uC774 \uC798 \uC644\uC131\uB418\uC5B4\uC57C \uD560 \uD150\uB370
      \uAC71\uC815\uC774\uB124\uC694"
    enText: "I hope the medicine turns out well\u2026 I'm worried"
  - startTime: 27.50966
    endTime: 30.05966
    koText: "\uC544\uC774\uAC00 \uB3C4\uCC29\uD55C \uAC83 \uAC19\uB124\uC694"
    enText: It sounds like the child has arrived
